              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DiamondGirl amanecer"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I\r\nloved this cocktail so much. It's a great island drink, reminds me of\r\ntropics. I substituted banana syrup for banana liqueur and used coconut\r\nmilk. I will use this recipe over and over.",
